# Eight Dockerfiles build from this tree: the QUIC Interop Runner endpoint
# (interop/Dockerfile), the comparison study's server and load generator
# (comparison/sluice/Dockerfile, comparison/loadgen/Dockerfile), and the
# contenders (comparison/go-nethttp/Dockerfile, comparison/rust-axum/Dockerfile,
# comparison/python-fastapi/Dockerfile, comparison/java-spring/Dockerfile,
# comparison/node-express/Dockerfile). They need the sources of their
# modules and the endpoint's entry script, nothing else. Everything is
# excluded by default so that nothing outside those files can reach an
# image; the Node contender's local packages stay out (its images install
# them with npm ci).
*
!**/*.go
!**/go.mod
!**/go.sum
!interop/run_endpoint.sh
!comparison/node-express/package.json
!comparison/node-express/package-lock.json
!comparison/node-express/**/*.js
comparison/node-express/node_modules/**
!comparison/rust-axum/Cargo.toml
!comparison/rust-axum/Cargo.lock
!comparison/rust-axum/src/**/*.rs
!comparison/python-fastapi/requirements.txt
!comparison/python-fastapi/**/*.py
!comparison/java-spring/pom.xml
!comparison/java-spring/src/**/*.java
